<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <section
    class="grid items-center gap-9 pt-7 pb-9 lg:grid-cols-[.95fr_1.05fr] lg:gap-10 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-12"
    aria-labelledby="hero-title"
  >
    <svg width="0" height="0" class="absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <defs>
        <clipPath id="road-photo-shape" clipPathUnits="objectBoundingBox">
          <path d="M .06 0 H .94 Q 1 0 1 .06 V .94 Q 1 1 .94 1 H .28 Q .22 1 .22 .94 V .90 Q .22 .84 .16 .84 H .06 Q 0 .84 0 .78 V .06 Q 0 0 .06 0 Z" />
        </clipPath>
        <clipPath id="story-photo-shape" clipPathUnits="objectBoundingBox">
          <path d="M .06 0 H .72 Q .78 0 .78 .08 V .14 Q .78 .22 .84 .22 H .94 Q 1 .22 1 .30 V .92 Q 1 1 .94 1 H .06 Q 0 1 0 .92 V .08 Q 0 0 .06 0 Z" />
        </clipPath>
      </defs>
    </svg>
    <div class="lg:py-8 lg:pl-3">
      <p class="mb-7 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-secondary sm:text-sm">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-secondary" /> A little more local knowledge.
      </p>
      <h1
        id="hero-title"
        class="max-w-xl text-[clamp(2rem,5.3vw,4.6rem)] leading-[1.12] font-medium text-primary"
      >
        The best route<br />isn't always<br /><span class="text-secondary">the shortest.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75 sm:text-base sm:leading-8">
        The potholes. The steep hill in traffic. The shortcut your car can't handle. We're building Wazi Route for the things a travel time doesn't tell you.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
        <.button
          id="hero-get-started"
          href="#coming-soon"
          data-coming-soon
          class="group inline-flex min-h-13 items-center justify-center gap-5 rounded-field bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-primary-content transition-colors hover:bg-secondary motion-reduce:transition-none"
        >
          Meet Wazi Route
          <.icon
            name="hero-arrow-up-right"
            class="size-5 motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:group-hover:translate-x-0.5 motion-safe:group-hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          />
        </.button>
        <a
          id="explore-how-it-works"
          href="#how-it-works"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-sm underline-offset-6 hover:underline"
        >
          How it works <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="size-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-base-content/65 lg:mt-14">
        In development. Starting with Nairobi's northwest.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <figure
        id="hero-photograph"
        class="relative h-[370px] overflow-hidden bg-secondary [clip-path:url(#road-photo-shape)] sm:h-[480px] lg:h-[610px]"
      >
        <img
          src={~p"/images/forest-road.jpg"}
          srcset={"#{~p"/images/forest-road-small.jpg"} 900w, #{~p"/images/forest-road.jpg"} 1800w"}
          sizes="(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 50vw"
          alt="An open road winding through a densely wooded landscape, seen from above"
          width="1800"
          height="1011"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="size-full object-cover object-[58%_center]"
        />
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-neutral/70 via-transparent to-transparent"
        />
        <figcaption class="absolute right-7 bottom-9 left-[28%] text-xl leading-snug font-medium text-white sm:text-2xl">
          A better feeling.<br />All the way home.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p id="preview-caption" class="mt-3 text-right text-[10px] leading-5 text-base-content/65">
        Photography for inspiration, not live route guidance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div
    id="local-context"
    class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-y border-base-300 py-6 text-xs sm:px-3 sm:text-sm"
  >
    <p class="font-medium text-primary">Built around real commutes.</p>
    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-base-content/70">
      Ruaka <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-secondary">/</span>
      Redhill <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-secondary">/</span>
      ABC <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-secondary">/</span>
      Loresho
    </p>
  </div>

  <section id="why-wazi" class="py-14 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="features-title">
    <div class="mb-10 grid items-end gap-6 lg:mb-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:gap-20 lg:px-3">
      <h2
        id="features-title"
        class="text-3xl leading-tight font-medium text-primary sm:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
      >
        Your car knows<br /><span class="text-secondary">the difference.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
        A shortcut isn't always a better way. We're looking beyond the arrival time, at the things that make a road right for you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid items-start gap-9 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16 xl:gap-24">
      <div>
        <figure
          id="road-detail-photograph"
          class="group relative h-[350px] overflow-hidden rounded-box bg-neutral text-neutral-content sm:h-[450px] lg:h-[520px]"
        >
          <img
            src={~p"/images/sunlit-road.jpg"}
            alt="Sunlight falling across an empty road under a canopy of trees"
            width="1200"
            height="1300"
            loading="lazy"
            class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-700 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div
            class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-neutral/80 via-transparent to-transparent"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />
          <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-7 bottom-8 text-3xl leading-tight font-medium text-white sm:inset-x-9 sm:text-4xl">
            Less second-guessing.<br />More open road.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mt-4 px-1 text-xs leading-6 text-base-content/65">
          For the daily commute. And the occasional long way home.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="feature-list" class="divide-y divide-base-300">
        <article id="feature-vehicle" class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-4 pb-7 sm:gap-6">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-1 text-sm text-secondary">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-primary sm:text-2xl">
              Your car. Your considerations.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              Low clearance? Manual gearbox? Start with your vehicle, so a route makes sense for what you're driving.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article id="feature-roads" class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-4 py-7 sm:gap-6">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-1 text-sm text-secondary">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-primary sm:text-2xl">
              More than a line on a map.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              Rough surfaces, awkward bumps, and road reports. The details you'd want to know before making the turn.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article id="feature-hills" class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-4 py-7 sm:gap-6">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-1 text-sm text-secondary">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-primary sm:text-2xl">
              Skip the uphill stop-start.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              A hill isn't always the problem. A queue on it might be. Look for alternatives to congested climbs, not every incline.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article id="feature-evidence" class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-4 pt-7 sm:gap-6">
          <.icon name="hero-information-circle" class="mt-1 size-5 text-secondary" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-primary">
              Good information includes the gaps.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              Clear reasons for each option. No pretending we know every road.
            </p>
            <a
              href="#coverage-note"
              class="mt-2 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium text-secondary underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
            >How we think about coverage <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="size-4" /></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="how-it-works"
    class="grid items-center gap-10 rounded-box bg-base-200 px-5 py-10 sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.95fr] lg:gap-16 lg:p-14"
    aria-labelledby="how-title"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-medium text-secondary">How it will work</p>
      <h2
        id="how-title"
        class="text-3xl leading-tight font-medium text-primary sm:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
      >
        A little context.<br />A better choice.
      </h2>
      <ol id="journey-steps" class="mt-9 space-y-7">
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-secondary">1.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-primary">Tell us about your drive.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              Your destination, your vehicle, and what you'd rather avoid.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-secondary">2.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-primary">Weigh up the alternatives.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              A quicker arrival or a smoother stretch? See the reasons, not just the arrival time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[1.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-0.5 text-sm text-secondary">3.</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-medium text-primary">Take the one that suits you.</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-base-content/75">
              Make the call. Share a road report to help the next driver along.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <aside
      id="drive-example"
      aria-labelledby="drive-example-title"
      class="border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-5 py-7 shadow-sm sm:px-8 sm:py-9"
    >
      <div class="mb-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/65">A commute, considered.</p><h3
            id="drive-example-title"
            class="mt-3 text-2xl font-medium text-primary"
          >
            What matters to you?
          </h3>
        </div>
        <.icon name="hero-adjustments-horizontal" class="mt-1 size-6 shrink-0 text-secondary" />
      </div>
      <dl class="divide-y divide-base-300 border-y border-base-300">
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-base-content/65">
            <.icon name="hero-key" class="size-4 text-secondary" /> The vehicle
          </dt><dd class="mt-2 pl-7 text-sm font-medium text-primary">
            Low clearance. Manual gearbox.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-base-content/65">
            <.icon name="hero-map" class="size-4 text-secondary" /> The road
          </dt><dd class="mt-2 pl-7 text-sm font-medium text-primary">
            A preference for smoother surfaces.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-base-content/65">
            <.icon name="hero-clock" class="size-4 text-secondary" /> The everyday frustration
          </dt><dd class="mt-2 pl-7 text-sm font-medium text-primary">
            Stop-start traffic on steep climbs.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-sm leading-7 text-primary">
        Same destination.<br />Different things to consider.
      </p>
      <p id="drive-example-note" class="mt-6 text-[11px] leading-5 text-base-content/65">
        Illustrative preferences, not a live route. This is the experience we're building.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section
    id="our-story"
    class="grid items-center gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20 lg:py-24"
    aria-labelledby="story-title"
  >
    <div class="px-2 lg:py-10 lg:pl-5">
      <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-secondary">From a very familiar commute.</p>
      <h2
        id="story-title"
        class="text-3xl leading-tight font-medium text-primary sm:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
      >
        It started with<br />that hill near ABC.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-md text-sm leading-8 text-base-content/80">
        A low car. A manual gearbox. A morning commute from Ruaka. When traffic backs up on the hill near ABC, the Loresho turn starts to make a lot more sense.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="my-8 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 text-xl leading-relaxed font-medium text-secondary sm:text-2xl">
        Not the shortest route.<br />Just a better drive for you.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="max-w-md text-[13px] leading-7 text-base-content/75">
        Wazi Route grew out of that everyday decision. We're starting with Nairobi's northwest corridors, and the roads we know first-hand.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#coming-soon"
        class="mt-7 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium text-primary underline-offset-6 hover:underline"
      >A new way to look at your commute
      <.icon name="hero-arrow-up-right" class="size-5 shrink-0" /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <figure
        id="story-photograph"
        class="group relative h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-secondary [clip-path:url(#story-photo-shape)] sm:h-[480px] lg:h-[540px]"
      >
        <img
          src={~p"/images/valley-road.jpg"}
          alt="A narrow road following the curves of a green, rocky valley"
          width="1000"
          height="1150"
          loading="lazy"
          class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-700 motion-safe:group-hover:scale-105"
        />
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-neutral/80 via-transparent to-transparent"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <figcaption class="absolute right-7 bottom-8 left-7 text-2xl leading-snug font-medium text-white sm:left-9 sm:text-3xl">
          Sometimes, the other way<br />is your way.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside
    id="coverage-note"
    class="mb-10 flex max-w-[880px] items-start gap-3.5 px-2 text-xs leading-7 text-base-content/75 lg:mb-14 lg:px-5"
  >
    <.icon name="hero-information-circle" class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-secondary" />
    <p>
      Road information won't cover everywhere. Unknown road conditions won't be labelled smooth or safe. Always follow road signs and your own judgement.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <section
    id="coming-soon"
    class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-box bg-secondary px-6 py-10 text-secondary-content sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] lg:gap-16 lg:px-14 lg:py-14"
    aria-labelledby="launch-section-title"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs text-secondary-content/80">A Nairobi beginning. More roads ahead.</p>
      <h2
        id="launch-section-title"
        class="text-3xl leading-tight font-medium sm:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
      >
        Here's to a<br />better way home.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:border-l lg:border-secondary-content/25 lg:pl-12">
      <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-secondary-content/85">
        We're getting the first roads ready. Accounts and route planning are still in development.
      </p>
      <.button
        id="launch-cta"
        href="#coming-soon"
        data-coming-soon
        class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-13 items-center justify-center gap-5 rounded-field bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-accent-content transition-colors hover:bg-base-100 hover:text-primary motion-reduce:transition-none"
      >
        Come along for the drive <.icon name="hero-arrow-up-right" class="size-5 shrink-0" />
      </.button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="mt-5 text-right text-[10px] leading-6 text-base-content/70 [&>a:hover]:underline">
    Photography: <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/vv-oEGlN-4E">Jerry Kavan</a>, <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/uOz71GyDVpo">Ryan Searle</a>, and
    <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/3Kv48NS4WUU">John Towner</a>
    / Unsplash
  </p>
</Layouts.app>
